// Everglade for desktop, its unit: the worlds (scenes.coax: the list, the Workshop, the Archery
// Range) and the Next issue panel (next.coax) compiled together. They are one unit because both
// draw with aethyr/ui/draw.coax, whose exports can't be linked twice. The worlds alone are what
// the mobile app compiles: it has no agent.
//   coax/bin/coax test --library apps/everglade-desktop/desktop.coax
#load "scenes.coax";
#load "next.coax";
